            'problem_definition' => 'The core problem this project addresses is that a robot teacher demonstration shows how physical presence can make short lessons more engaging than a slide deck alone. Left unaddressed, this gap means the relevant task continues to depend on manual effort or goes unaddressed altogether. The specific objectives of this project are: (1) implement a working educational teaching robot pipeline using Python; (2) demonstrate the pipeline reliably on realistic input, not just a single cherry-picked example; (3) document the system\'s behavior, including its known limitations, clearly enough for an evaluator to understand what was and was not achieved.',
